# CLAUDE.md — Claude-specific behaviour for `{{MODULE_NAME}}`

Claude's role, routing preferences, and escalation duties in this module. The
multi-agent contract that governs every agent lives in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md);
read it first. Claude's routing rules are in
[skills/claude/SKILLS.md](skills/claude/SKILLS.md). The engineering side is in
[skills/codex/SKILLS.md](skills/codex/SKILLS.md).

Where this file and AGENTS.md disagree, **AGENTS.md wins**.

## Project invariant

[Regent](https://github.com/felipe-quintella/regent) is the single tool for
validating and testing this module: `regent validate`, `regent test`,
`regent build`. Do not invoke host `puppet`, `rspec`, `bundle`, or `pdk`. A
missing gem is fixed with `regent bootstrap`, never `gem install`. See
[AGENTS.md §0](AGENTS.md).

